# Dragon Quest VII Reimagined (PPSA17942) — locomotion probe.
#
# Mashes confirm to t=700 to reach the field state, then alternates eight 28 s stick windows
# against eight matched neutral windows, entirely inside it. Confirms STOP at 700 so a press can
# never be mistaken for movement.
#
# The measurement is masked minimap CHANGE, not world motion and not phase correlation. Compare
# the disc interior
# between each window's first and last field frame. Reproduce with
# scripts/dragon-quest-vii/classify_field.py locomotion -- the exact window list is in
# scripts/dragon-quest-vii/README.md:
#
#     stick held   masked minimap change >= 15 in 8 of 8 windows, median 24.9
#     neutral      >= 15 in 0 of 8, median 3.0, max 12.7
#
# Measure the HUD, not the world. A world region flicking between rendered and collapsed swamps
# the signal on this title; the minimap is drawn correctly regardless. See #1874.

